    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate the Skies</strong> is a VR narrative-driven action arcade game that fuses high-speed racing with explosive combat in a dystopian future ruled by mafia families. Pilot advanced anti-gravity vehicles, outpace rivals, and rise to power in a gripping story of betrayal, rivalry, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a powerful anti-gravity vehicle, with advanced tech and weapons to outpace and outgun your competitors. As a rising star in the mafia underworld, you\u2019ll battle your way through dangerous streets and skyways, racing for survival, wealth, and power. Engage in cutthroat combat with rival factions, unlock new areas, and build your reputation in this brutal world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on <strong><u>Discord</u></strong> to help shape the game, share your feedback, and connect with other players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR-Exclusive Thrills</strong>: Fully immersive gameplay designed to pull you into every race, battle, and narrative twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futuristic Racing</strong>: Speed through exhilarating tracks in cutting-edge anti-gravity vehicles. Precision and speed are your allies in every heart-pounding race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Racing</strong>: Arm your vehicles with advanced weapons and gadgets. Take out your enemies as you race for dominance in high-stakes dogfights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mafia Underworld Storyline</strong>: Navigate a dangerous world of rival factions, climbing the ranks of a powerful mafia family to seize control of the skies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong>: Engage in adrenaline-fueled gameplay requiring quick decisions and ruthless tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong>: Test your skills against players worldwide in PvP battles or team up in multiplayer races and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong>: Explore diverse, futuristic terrains filled with hazards and challenges designed to test your skills to the limit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have suggestions or ideas?  <strong>Join us on Discord</strong> to help build and refine <i>Dominate the Skies</i>! Only the boldest racers and fiercest fighters will thrive\u2014can you take the lead?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate the Skies</strong> is a VR narrative-driven action arcade game that fuses high-speed racing with explosive combat in a dystopian future ruled by mafia families. Pilot advanced anti-gravity vehicles, outpace rivals, and rise to power in a gripping story of betrayal, rivalry, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a powerful anti-gravity vehicle, with advanced tech and weapons to outpace and outgun your competitors. As a rising star in the mafia underworld, you\u2019ll battle your way through dangerous streets and skyways, racing for survival, wealth, and power. Engage in cutthroat combat with rival factions, unlock new areas, and build your reputation in this brutal world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on <strong><u>Discord</u></strong> to help shape the game, share your feedback, and connect with other players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR-Exclusive Thrills</strong>: Fully immersive gameplay designed to pull you into every race, battle, and narrative twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futuristic Racing</strong>: Speed through exhilarating tracks in cutting-edge anti-gravity vehicles. Precision and speed are your allies in every heart-pounding race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Racing</strong>: Arm your vehicles with advanced weapons and gadgets. Take out your enemies as you race for dominance in high-stakes dogfights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mafia Underworld Storyline</strong>: Navigate a dangerous world of rival factions, climbing the ranks of a powerful mafia family to seize control of the skies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong>: Engage in adrenaline-fueled gameplay requiring quick decisions and ruthless tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong>: Test your skills against players worldwide in PvP battles or team up in multiplayer races and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong>: Explore diverse, futuristic terrains filled with hazards and challenges designed to test your skills to the limit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have suggestions or ideas?  <strong>Join us on Discord</strong> to help build and refine <i>Dominate the Skies</i>! Only the boldest racers and fiercest fighters will thrive\u2014can you take the lead?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Dominate the Skies&quot; is a narrative-driven VR action arcade game where fast-paced racing meets intense aerial combat. Pilot cutting-edge anti-gravity vehicles, unravel a gripping story of rival factions, and dominate high-stake battles in a futuristic world of power and betrayal.",
